cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-sdk-java in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-sdk-java: a typed Java client for the pain001 REST API"
abstract: >-
  A typed Java client for the pain001 REST API, which generates and
  validates ISO 20022 pain.001 credit-transfer and pain.008 direct-debit
  payment files. It is proven against the server by the pain001 SDK
  conformance kit.
authors:
